88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-16T12:22:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T02:42:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1stable, 4.5stable, 4.4.1stable, 4.4stable, 4.3stable, 4.2.2stable(and before, perhaps?)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7628) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12490F (12 threads) - 31.81 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nCan't edit ~~some~~ four types custom data in TileSet editor: `Any`, `RID`, `Callable`, `Signal`.\n\n_Tips: It was just a coincidental discovery while developing a grid-based game. Surprisingly, after testing many older versions, it appears that this issue has always existed._\n\n#### Demo:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e69c6b73-6c00-4d7f-ba9e-b1d9b01db6ac\n\nAlso tested the method of modifying custom data through scripts, it works fine. It seems an only editor-related issue.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1390\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d58f0995-009f-411f-a739-1719b241582d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nVery easy to reproduce, just change custom data type and then try to edit some tile's custom data in TileSet editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[custom-data-issue_2025-10-16_21-43-50.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22950636/custom-data-issue_2025-10-16_21-43-50.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111717/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}